      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 267,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1899,
      "text": "We know that you are distressed by what they say.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 97,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 267,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1900,
      "text": "So glorify your Lord with praise and be among those who prostrate [to Him][51],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 98,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 267,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1901,
      "text": "and worship your Lord until the certainty [of death] comes to you.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 15,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الحِجۡرِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Hijr",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Rock",
        "numberOfAyahs": 99,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 99,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 267,
      "ruku": 223,
      "hizbQuarter": 106,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1902,
      "text": "Allah’s decree is coming[1], so do not seek to hasten it. Glorified and Exalted is He far above what they associate with Him[2]!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 267,
      "ruku": 224,
      "hizbQuarter": 107,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1903,
      "text": "He sends down the angels with revelation by His command to whom He wills of His slaves, [saying], “Warn that none has the right to be worshiped except Me, so fear Me.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 267,
      "ruku": 224,
      "hizbQuarter": 107,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1904,
      "text": "He created the heavens and earth for a true purpose. Exalted is He far above what they associate with Him!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 267,
      "ruku": 224,
      "hizbQuarter": 107,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1905,
      "text": "He created man from a sperm-drop, and then he becomes a clear adversary[3].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 14,
      "manzil": 3,
      "page": 267,
      "ruku": 224,
      "hizbQuarter": 107,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 1906,
      "text": "And He has created the livestock for you as a source of warmth and other benefits[4], and from them you eat.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 16,
        "name": "سُورَةُ النَّحۡلِ",
        "englishName": "An-Nahl",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Bee",
        "numberOfAyahs": 128,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 14,
